//! The `padding` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property sets the [padding
//! area](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Box_model/Introduction#padding_area)
//! on all four sides of an element at once.
//!
//! Initial: padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the width of the containing block.
//!
//! Grammar: <'padding-top'>{1,4}
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-box-4/#propdef-padding
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/padding
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

